From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Andrew Eikum <aeikum@codeweavers.com>
Date: Tue, 28 Dec 2021 12:05:22 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] xaudio2: Prefer native

This should be safe now on 64-bit due to the top-down allocation
patches.

(cherry picked from commit 095fdddb5e186a48f55a3d529c3b7d99c89d2ef6)
mproton-resolved: kept 11.20's version-resource lines next to the --prefer-native flag.
